# Generated by the model scripts and the CAD integrations; rebuild instead of committing.
# A project's own .gitignore can re-include a committed input with a ! rule.
/*/STEP/*
/*/STL/*
/*/GLB/*
/*/FreeCAD/*
/*/SolidWorks/*
# Generated report PDFs (their .yaml, .py and .tex sources are tracked), and each model's reference material (source reports, figures, notes)
/*/reports/*.pdf
/*/reports/*_report.json
/*/profile/
/model_fidelity.pdf
# Generated unified STEP sidecars are rebuilt from the model's Python declarations.
*.step.json
*.stp.json
